April 15th

c0791
01:08:24.420 --> 01:08:26.220
we will have a luncheon lecture

c0792
01:08:26.220 --> 01:08:28.820
in which here at the college

c0793
01:08:28.820 --> 01:08:29.500
that's a Friday

c0794
01:08:29.500 --> 01:08:32.320
on which Professor Faor will speak about

c0795
